<body>
<a href="#review" class="skip">跳到邮件预览</a>
<header class="masthead"><div><p class="eyebrow">REIN PROTOCOL FOUNDATION / CORRESPONDENCE</p><h1>邮件模板审阅</h1><p>欢迎、联络、通知与账号安全，在这里一起查看。</p></div><div class="total"><strong id="total">—</strong><span>模板与变体 / 4 组</span></div></header>
<div class="workspace">
<aside class="directory" aria-label="邮件模板目录">
<label class="search-label" for="search">查找邮件</label><input class="search" id="search" type="search" placeholder="名称、用途或主题…" autocomplete="off"><p class="search-count" id="search-count" aria-live="polite"></p><nav id="navigation" aria-label="按用途浏览模板"></nav><p class="empty" id="empty" hidden>没有找到匹配的模板。试试 “Welcome” 或 “验证”。</p>
</aside>
<main class="review" id="review" tabindex="-1">
<div class="review-heading"><h2 id="template-title"></h2><span class="status" id="status"></span></div>
<p class="description" id="description"></p>
<div class="subject"><span class="subject-label">主题</span><span id="subject"></span></div>
<details class="metadata"><summary>查看来源与示例变量</summary><p class="source" id="source"></p><dl id="variables"></dl></details>
<div class="toolbar"><div class="width-controls" role="group" aria-label="预览宽度"><button type="button" id="desktop" aria-pressed="true">桌面 · 760px</button><button type="button" id="mobile" aria-pressed="false">手机 · 375px</button></div><span class="preview-note">点击邮件链接查看目标，不会跳转或发送。</span></div>
<div class="canvas"><div class="frame-wrap" id="frame-wrap"><iframe id="preview" title="邮件预览" sandbox="allow-same-origin"></iframe></div></div>
<p class="link-target" id="link-target" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
<details class="links"><summary>检查邮件中的链接 <span id="link-count"></span></summary><ol id="links"></ol></details>
<footer class="review-footer"><span>独立 HTML · 图片已内嵌，可离线审阅</span><span>显示示例数据；实际邮箱客户端排版可能不同。</span></footer>
